{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07526","headline":"赠僧皎然 · 颜真卿","name":"赠僧皎然","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋意西山多，别岑萦左次。\n缮亭历三癸，趾趾邻什寺。\n元化隐灵踪，始君啓高致。\n诛榛养翘楚，鞭草理芳穗。\n俯砌披水容，逼天扫峰翠。\n境新耳目换，物远风尘异。\n倚石忘世情，援云得真意。\n嘉林幸勿剪，禅侣欣可庇。\n卫法大臣过，佐游羣英萃。\n龙池护清激，虎节到深邃。\n徒想嵊顶期，于今没遗记。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜真卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}